BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_315223293@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260630T041951Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T111500
SUMMARY:Simple Sitting Meditation
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\nIn these sessions\, I will be doing guided
  meditations where we simply sit and notice what arises.\n\nThere is no ag
 enda and no plan for how these sessions unfold. I might start off simply b
 y asking us to notice what is already present. By becoming aware of what
 ’s going on in our heads and in our body.\n\nThen\, the meditation may t
 ake on a life of its own.\n\nOur job is to simply be present to what arise
 s. We may notice the mind moving and chattering about. Or we may notice th
 at it’s completely silent.\n\nThe goal here\, if there is one\, is to si
 mply let ourselves be as we are.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/315223293/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260612T021140Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T021140Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_315450435@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260630T041951Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T104500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T110500
SUMMARY:Inner Body Meditation (20 Minutes)
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\n"Awareness of the inner body takes you bey
 ond the mind." - Eckhart Tolle\n\nIn this mediation session we will bring 
 our attention here: to the inner body. Sessions are suitable for newcomers
 \, those experienced in Tolle's teachings and anyone wishing to remain com
 pletely anonymous. They will last around 20 minutes and cameras and microp
 hones will be disabled.\n\n(Depending on the situation\, a free discussion
  may be held at the end with mics and cameras allowed.)\n\nSee you there!\
 n\nPlease be aware that sessions will close if no members have joined afte
 r 10 minutes.\n\nEmrys also organises a free Work of Byron Katie online me
 diation group. Visit [this Meetup Group link](https://www.meetup.com/thewo
 rk-runsfree/) for more information.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/315450435/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260628T053633Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260628T053633Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
